# YASII / ЯСИИ Naming Rule

Use only these spellings for the platform AI employee:

- **YASII** — English name (code, identifiers, technical docs, API, file names)
- **ЯСИИ** — Russian name (user-facing Russian text, Russian docs)

**Forbidden:** `ЯСII` (Cyrillic «ЯС» + Latin «II»). This mixed script looks like a typo.

When writing or editing project text:

- Russian prose → **ЯСИИ**
- English/technical identifiers → **YASII**
- Never introduce `ЯСII` or other mixed-script variants

Apply in: UI, Dashboard, README, architecture docs, roadmap, work items, analyzer descriptions, comments, tests, seed data.
